    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Rise for the Fight</strong> is an upcoming Cartoon Multiplayer FPS game being developed by Reece Makes Games.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1871970/extras/99b51c93f348029a22613f48ea1b782d.poster.avif?t=1754694782\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1871970/extras/99b51c93f348029a22613f48ea1b782d.webm?t=1754694782\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1871970/extras/99b51c93f348029a22613f48ea1b782d.mp4?t=1754694782\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Rise for the Fight's core gameplay is all about guns, kills, and damage. Deal damage, get kills, and gain multikills to acquire:<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1871970/extras/c658f5ebed21e3da38936b3a56555596.avif?t=1754694782\" /></div><br><br>Upgrade Points! <br><br>Use your Upgrade Points to upgrade your gun's rate of fire and ammo capacity, or exchange your equipped gun for a new gun.  <br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1871970/extras/46296c19e0189a68004bf4d74f09b9ea.avif?t=1754694782\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">New weapons can be acquired at the Gungen Vending Machines located around the map. It will cost you 5 Upgrade Points to get a random weapon. Upgrade Points will be refunded, and more ammo will be supplied (when applicable) if you are given the same weapon.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1871970/extras/de7605e309239eb1ee8a4f174513f1b1.poster.avif?t=1754694782\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1871970/extras/de7605e309239eb1ee8a4f174513f1b1.webm?t=1754694782\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1871970/extras/de7605e309239eb1ee8a4f174513f1b1.mp4?t=1754694782\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><br>Keep yourself aware at all times, and be careful because\u00a0<strong>if you die, your purchased weapons and gun stats will be reset...</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Features: </strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- Expansive and Expressive Character Customization, with more coming in the future.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- Unique Twists to Classic Game Modes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- Several Simple yet Unique Maps to fight on.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- Over 10 Different Guns to play with.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- Singleplayer Mode (Requires Internet Connection to play)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Controls (KEYBOARD AND MOUSE): </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- WASD = Move <br>- Left Shift + WASD = Sprint <br>- C = Crouch <br>- Crouch + Sprint = Slide <br>- Left Click = Shoot <br>- Right Click = Aim <br>- R = Reload<br>- F = Melee<br>- G = Equip Grenade / Swap back to Gun<br>- H = Heal <br>- E = Interact <br>- 1/2/3 = Upgrade Gun Stats </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Notes:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- This game's servers are set to US East, so if you are in a different region, you may experience high ping.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> - The Server has a maximum player capacity of 100. This will be expanded on if needed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- Expect bugs to be present in this game, as it's in early development.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">If you come across any issues with the game, please submit feedback in the comments on what can be improved.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Have Fun!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">-Reece</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Rise for the Fight</strong> is an upcoming Cartoon Multiplayer FPS game being developed by Reece Makes Games.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1871970/extras/99b51c93f348029a22613f48ea1b782d.poster.avif?t=1754694782\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1871970/extras/99b51c93f348029a22613f48ea1b782d.webm?t=1754694782\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1871970/extras/99b51c93f348029a22613f48ea1b782d.mp4?t=1754694782\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Rise for the Fight's core gameplay is all about guns, kills, and damage. Deal damage, get kills, and gain multikills to acquire:<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1871970/extras/c658f5ebed21e3da38936b3a56555596.avif?t=1754694782\" /></div><br><br>Upgrade Points! <br><br>Use your Upgrade Points to upgrade your gun's rate of fire and ammo capacity, or exchange your equipped gun for a new gun.  <br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1871970/extras/46296c19e0189a68004bf4d74f09b9ea.avif?t=1754694782\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">New weapons can be acquired at the Gungen Vending Machines located around the map. It will cost you 5 Upgrade Points to get a random weapon. Upgrade Points will be refunded, and more ammo will be supplied (when applicable) if you are given the same weapon.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1871970/extras/de7605e309239eb1ee8a4f174513f1b1.poster.avif?t=1754694782\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1871970/extras/de7605e309239eb1ee8a4f174513f1b1.webm?t=1754694782\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1871970/extras/de7605e309239eb1ee8a4f174513f1b1.mp4?t=1754694782\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><br>Keep yourself aware at all times, and be careful because\u00a0<strong>if you die, your purchased weapons and gun stats will be reset...</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Features: </strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- Expansive and Expressive Character Customization, with more coming in the future.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- Unique Twists to Classic Game Modes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- Several Simple yet Unique Maps to fight on.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- Over 10 Different Guns to play with.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- Singleplayer Mode (Requires Internet Connection to play)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Controls (KEYBOARD AND MOUSE): </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- WASD = Move <br>- Left Shift + WASD = Sprint <br>- C = Crouch <br>- Crouch + Sprint = Slide <br>- Left Click = Shoot <br>- Right Click = Aim <br>- R = Reload<br>- F = Melee<br>- G = Equip Grenade / Swap back to Gun<br>- H = Heal <br>- E = Interact <br>- 1/2/3 = Upgrade Gun Stats </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Notes:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- This game's servers are set to US East, so if you are in a different region, you may experience high ping.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> - The Server has a maximum player capacity of 100. This will be expanded on if needed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- Expect bugs to be present in this game, as it's in early development.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">If you come across any issues with the game, please submit feedback in the comments on what can be improved.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Have Fun!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">-Reece</p>",
